IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0007.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PAY0007C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> OVERTIME PAY
    05 OVERTIME-PAY       PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CALC-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "OVERTIME-PAY=" OVERTIME-PAY
    STOP RUN.
CALC-OVERTIME.
    *> NO OVERTIME FOR CONTRACTORS
    IF EMP-TYPE = 'C'
        MOVE 0 TO OVERTIME-PAY
    *> HEAVY OVERTIME
    ELSE IF WEEK-HOURS GREATER THAN 55
        COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY ROUNDED = GROSS-PAY * 0.30
    ELSE IF WEEK-HOURS > 40
        COMPUTE OVERTIME-PAY = GROSS-PAY * 0.15
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO OVERTIME-PAY
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
